OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785881888
OL,3,CMan jailed for burglary and sexual
OL,4,Cassault of 94-year-old at her home
OL,6,FA burglar who sexually assaulted a
OL,7,Fwoman, 94, in her Doncaster home has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed.
OL,10,FTyler Clarke, 25, was arrested
OL,11,Ffollowing a report of a burglary at
OL,12,FSheila Wood's bungalow in December
OL,13,Flast year.
OL,15,FForensic analysis uncovered
OL,16,Ffingerprints that matched Clarke's on
OL,17,Fnumerous items, including a chest of
OL,18,Fdrawers and a photo frame.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785881888
OL,3,CMan jailed for burglary and sexual
OL,4,Cassault of 94-year-old at her home
OL,6,FOfficers then tracked down Clarke at
OL,7,Fan address in the Balby area of
OL,8,FDoncaster where he was found hiding in
OL,9,Fa wardrobe.
OL,11,FA search of that property also saw
OL,12,Fofficers retrieve a hat which matched
OL,13,Fclothing worn by Clarke on CCTV.
OL,15,FOn Monday 3 August, Clarke, of HMP
OL,16,FDoncaster, was given an extended
OL,17,Fsentence of 18-and-a-half years for
OL,18,Fburglary and sexual assault.
OL,20,FThis justice came too late for Sheila,
OL,21,Fwho died earlier this year.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785881888
OL,3,CMan jailed for burglary and sexual
OL,4,Cassault of 94-year-old at her home
OL,6,FIn tribute to her, her family called
OL,7,Fher "the brightest beacon of light".
OL,9,FThey wrote: "Tyler Clarke blew up our
OL,10,Flives, destroyed our family's peace
OL,11,Fand set a terrifying domino effect in
OL,12,Fmotion that dimmed and then
OL,13,Fpermanently extinguished Sheila's
OL,14,Fbright light.
OL,16,F"Her little bungalow was her safe
OL,17,Fhaven and it was there that he not
OL,18,Fonly physically attacked her, but
OL,19,Fattacked her in the worst, most
OL,20,Fdepraved way imaginable."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785881888
OL,3,CMan jailed for burglary and sexual
OL,4,Cassault of 94-year-old at her home
OL,6,FHer family say the attack meant Sheila
OL,7,Fnever felt safe at home again,
OL,8,Fstealing her independence and peace of
OL,9,Fmind.
OL,11,FThey added: "As a family, we are
OL,12,Fcarrying a horror and a grief that
OL,13,Fnobody should ever have to think about
OL,14,Fwhen they close their eyes at night."
OL,16,FDetective Sergeant Lee Robinson said
OL,17,Fthat forensics helped bring Clarke to
OL,18,Fjustice.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785881888
OL,3,CMan jailed for burglary and sexual
OL,4,Cassault of 94-year-old at her home
OL,6,FHe said: "This was a horrific and
OL,7,Fwicked attack on a vulnerable and
OL,8,Felderly woman whose life was sadly
OL,9,Fchanged forever.
OL,11,F"Sheila's courage and openness meant
OL,12,Fwe were able to understand the more
OL,13,Fsinister nature behind this break-in
OL,14,Fand ensured that we conducted a
OL,15,Fforensic-led investigation which
OL,16,Fswiftly led us to identifying Clarke
OL,17,Fas our suspect.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,335,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F334A1785881888
OL,3,CMan jailed for burglary and sexual
OL,4,Cassault of 94-year-old at her home
OL,6,F"There is no justifiable explanation
OL,7,Ffor what he did and I am pleased we
OL,8,Fwere able to secure justice on behalf
OL,9,Fof Sheila's family and in honour and
OL,10,Fmemory of Sheila herself."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
